alues><field id="imageURL" type="input"><value>//sc04.alicdn.com/kf/H36e700f5c3ee447a80c035d8ae7521d9a/286385890/H36e700f5c3ee447a80c035d8ae7521d9a.jpg</value></field></complex-values></field><field id="gallery" type="singleCheck"><value displayName="Production workflow">600</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="images" type="multiComplex"><complex-values><field id="imageURL" type="input"><value>//sc04.alicdn.com/kf/H9f32c7ecea0f4d25bc5ddc9cd04c1e5dK/286385890/H9f32c7ecea0f4d25bc5ddc9cd04c1e5dK.jpg</value></field></complex-values></field><field id="gallery" type="singleCheck"><value displayName="Extended company profile">750</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="images" type="multiComplex"><complex-values><field id="imageURL" type="input"><value>//sc04.alicdn.com/kf/H5f71c3cfb4064b51bb458d0a786cb402R/286385890/H5f71c3cfb4064b51bb458d0a786cb402R.jpg</value></field></complex-values></field><field id="gallery" type="singleCheck"><value displayName="Packaging &amp; shipping specifications">700</value></field></complex-values></field><field id="textDesc" type="input"><value>Colorblock women's Mary Jane flats with a single hook-and-loop strap, closed toe and closed heel. Confirmed source materials: synthetic leather upper and lining, rubber outsole and PU insole; cemented construction. Three source colors: Grey, Green and Blue. Listed size labels: 35, 36, 37, 38, 39 and 40; measured fit and international size conversion are confirmed for the order. The midsole composition is not specified. Send your color-size quantities, destination, packing requirements and requested dispatch date for an order-specific quotation. Availability and supply terms are confirmed during inquiry; the listing does not guarantee ready stock.</value></field><field id="companyDesc" type="input"><value>Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear &amp; Apparel Co., Ltd. supports footwear wholesale inquiries. The company capability images below describe general business capabilities. Product-specific supply, samples, customization, packing and dispatch are assessed against your order requirements before quotation.</value></field><field id="companyFaqDesc" type="multiComplex"><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>What materials are used?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>The source specifies synthetic leather for the upper and lining, rubber for the outsole, PU for the insole and cemented construction. Midsole composition is not specified. Send any additional material requirements with your inquiry.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Which colors and sizes can I request?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Listed source colors are Grey, Green and Blue, with size labels 35-40. Please provide a quantity for every requested color and size. Measurements, fit and any international size conversion are confirmed for your order.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>How does this shoe close?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>The actual photos show a single hook-and-loop strap across the instep, a closed toe and a closed heel. Review the pictured shape and opening for your intended assortment.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>What are the minimum and quantity prices?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>The listing minimum is 2 pairs. Indicative unit prices are USD 13.44 for 2-49 pairs, USD 12.54 for 50-99 pairs and USD 11.65 for 100 or more pairs. Final quotation depends on the color-size mix, packing, destination and agreed order terms; freight and any taxes are confirmed separately.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Can I order samples or request customization?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Send your sample quantity or customization requirements with the color-size mix. Feasibility, sample charges, logo or packing options and any applicable minimums are assessed before quotation.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Is stock or a dispatch date guaranteed?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>No ready-stock or fixed dispatch promise is made. Provide your total quantity, destination, packing requirements and requested dispatch date. Supply, per-size availability, payment terms and the dispatch arrangement are confirmed for your inquiry.</value></field></complex-values></field></itemSchema>